[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18661.31, "timestamp": "05:11:01", "text": "危機。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18663.99, "timestamp": "05:11:03", "text": "くそ。私はまだ彼らをフォローしていません。私はかなり"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18665.91, "timestamp": "05:11:05", "text": "近い。でも他のみんなは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18668.23, "timestamp": "05:11:08", "text": "兵器。何？あなたと私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18669.67, "timestamp": "05:11:09", "text": "クロス。どういう意味ですか？他の全員、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18671.948, "timestamp": "05:11:11", "text": "あなたは武器を持っています。待って、君"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18677.75, "timestamp": "05:11:17", "text": "え？を引かないで。待って、引っ張らないで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18680.708, "timestamp": "05:11:20", "text": "幾億年もの時。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18682.628, "timestamp": "05:11:22", "text": "待って、キャラクターのためにガチャを引くわけじゃないよね。あなた"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 18687.863, "timestamp": "05:11:27", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "there is no 50/50 on the weapon banner"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 18694.895, "timestamp": "05:11:34", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "so you get them everytime no matter what"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18697.67, "timestamp": "05:11:37", "text": "海は鏡だ。彼女はクラゲですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18699.83, "timestamp": "05:11:39", "text": "彼女はクラゲみたいだ。ない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18702.11, "timestamp": "05:11:42", "text": "50/50で"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18708.67, "timestamp": "05:11:48", "text": "バナー。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18711.67, "timestamp": "05:11:51", "text": "だから、どんなに"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18713.39, "timestamp": "05:11:53", "text": "何。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18717.35, "timestamp": "05:11:57", "text": "おお。しかし、問題は